                <p id="manyshot-exploit">
                    <strong>Many-Shot Jailbreaking (The Context Window Exploit):</strong> Discovered by Anthropic in 2024, this technique exploits models with massive context windows (100k - 1M tokens). By providing hundreds of synthetic examples of the model answering harmful questions (the "shots"), the model's safety alignment is completely overwhelmed by the sheer volume of in-context learning.
                </p>
                
